Merchant oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Adds an optional shop-hours override to GetArmsDealerShopHours (inactive unless the oracle sets it) and appends wrappers
around the static shopkeeper interface helpers (CalcShopKeeperItemPrice, ItemConditionModifier, EvaluateInvSlot,
HandlePossibleRepairDelays, and the inventory part of InitializeShopKeeper) that select the dealer and an SM-panel merc
for the call and restore them afterwards. No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0006.

